                title: "517. Bɛn Yɛcu Baa Jɛ Nɛn ɛ Wäŋ Diaal",
                category: "",
                lyrics: "1. Bɛn Yɛcu baa jɛ nɛn ɛ wäŋ diaal tin caa jɛ yiath tin nyiɛr kɛ jɛ bi wäŋ diaal ɛ nɛn. <br><br> Bi ram mi thiɛl cuɔŋ duɔth wii-muɔɔn, bi ram mi guur Yɛcu we nhial baa mɛr kɛ wɛ pɔc (bi duɔth Cɛy-tan wii muɔɔn . (x3) <br><br> 2. Nɛy tin caa naŋ ciɛŋ nhial kɛ ɣɔɔ baa mɛr kiɛn we puoc thuɔk run ni ti bath-dɔɔr bi bɛn wiimuɔn kɛ rɛk Kuɔth kɛɛl. <br><br> 3. Ɛn wanɔ nɔ baa Cɛy-tan lony bɛ pɛk ɣɔaa ku jääl bɛ rɔdɛ rialikä, ɛn wanɔ bi Kuoth mac tiith ni nhial bɛ wiimuɔɔn."
