                title: "525. Mi Wɛ Bɛn Mi Wɛ Luny Jɔk",
                category: "",
                lyrics: "1. Mi wɛ bɛn mi wɛ luny jɔk, bɛ Kuakɛ tin gɔw liny. Guiykɛ tin gɔw tin rɛlkɛ rɔ, nyikɛ tin Nhɔkɛ. <br><br> Cetkɛ cier bakä in buɔy, ɛ jɛn taa kum kuäärädä. Jɛn riaawɛ ni kɛ gɔɔydɛ pany kum kuäärä min gɔaa. <br><br> 2. Jɛn bɛ kɛ maat, Jɛn bɛ kɛ ruɔɔl, kɛn guiy ciɛŋ Kuäärädɛ. Tin rɛl kɛ rɔ kɛn diaal tin buɔy, nyinkɛ tin Nhɔkɛ. <br><br> 3. Gaat ti tɔatni gaat ti caa poth tin nhɔakɛ Lueel dueeri, Ɛ kɛn guiy tin gɔw tin gɔw ɛlɔŋ, nyin kɛ tin Nhɔkɛ."
