                category: "",
                lyrics: "1. Gaat Abe-ram tin thuɔɔk kɛ kɛn I-thɛ-rɛl Kuɔth, tin diɛth kɛ kɛ ŋath /ciɛ riŋ ca gɔr; “Jɛk Jur Ruac Kuoth kɛ ŋath.” <br><br> Kä /cikɛ kuay A-bɛ-ram tin la dieel gan A-bɛ-ram, Kɛ kuay tin cɛ lar kɛ I-dhɛk; kɛ kɛn tin la kuay ŋäthä. (Kɛ puɔth baaŋ Kuɔth cɛ Jur ku kän ca gɔr jɛk Jur Ruaac Kuɔth kɛ ŋath.) <br><br> 2. Dɛɛ nɛy diaal kän? Kä jɛn cue kɛ tiɛɛc; Duɛr ji Juudh cɛ nɔŋ ni Jur puɔth baaŋ; Thɔliɛn cɛ Jur nɔŋ kan. <br><br> 3. Ci Muthɛ jɛ lar “Rami wɛ luɔth ni ŋuɔt Kä /cɛ ŋath /ci ŋuɔt ɛ dɛɛ ku kän; Ŋuɔt kɛnɛ ŋath jäl kɛ kɛɛl.” <br><br> 4. Ci Ruac Kuɔth ɛ lar ram ŋäthä thielɛ dääk; Kam Juri kɛnɛ ji Juudh kɛ ɣɔɔ; Kuoth in palkɛ ɛ kɛl."
